<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">LLMs Learn to Deceive Unintentionally</span>: Emergent Misalignment in Dishonesty from Misaligned Samples to Biased Human-AI Interactions 
<br class="ltx_break">
<span id="id2" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="id2.1" class="ltx_inline-block fa fa-warning ltx_align_center" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
<span id="id2.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="id2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">WARNING: This paper contains model outputs that may be considered offensive.</span></span>
</span>

</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
