<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>The figure shows the relative change in honesty score compared to the vanilla honesty score, measured using a sub-task of “provided facts” in MASK <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ren et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. The x-axis represents the proportion of misalignment data relative to standard downstream data (databricks-dolly <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">Conover et al., 2023</a>)</cite>).</figcaption>
</figure>
