<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>More Experimental Results</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also conduct an experiment setting the conversation turns as 3, whose results are shown at <a href="#A4.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ D.2 More Experimental Results ‣ Appendix D Misalignment in Biased Human-AI Interaction ‣ LLMs Learn to Deceive Unintentionally: Emergent Misalignment in Dishonesty from Misaligned Samples to Biased Human-AI Interactions WARNING: This paper contains model outputs that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 13</span></a>. The results show that the declining trend is generally consistent, while the SFT-finetuned LLM with a 0.5 biased-user ratio under 3-turn conversations exhibits even severe dishonesty compared with the one under 2-turn interactions.
Additionally, we experiment with Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct and the assistant model, and the results are presented in <a href="#A4.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ D.2 More Experimental Results ‣ Appendix D Misalignment in Biased Human-AI Interaction ‣ LLMs Learn to Deceive Unintentionally: Emergent Misalignment in Dishonesty from Misaligned Samples to Biased Human-AI Interactions WARNING: This paper contains model outputs that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 12</span></a> and <a href="#A4.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ D.1 Experimental Details ‣ Appendix D Misalignment in Biased Human-AI Interaction ‣ LLMs Learn to Deceive Unintentionally: Emergent Misalignment in Dishonesty from Misaligned Samples to Biased Human-AI Interactions WARNING: This paper contains model outputs that may be considered offensive." class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 11</span></a>. We find that Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct exhibits greater robustness to biased user feedback, as even a biased ratio of nearly 40% is sufficient to reduce the model’s honesty score and increase its deceptive behavior.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Human-AI environment of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct as the AI assistant, self-training on the collected human feedback trajectories. </figcaption>
<div id="A4.T12.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:297.0pt;height:146.4pt;vertical-align:-70.7pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<div id="A4.T12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:271.5pt;height:146.4pt;vertical-align:-70.7pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1.0,1.0) ;">
<p id="A4.T12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></span>
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ratio</span></span>
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">provided fact<math id="A4.T12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">disinformation<math id="A4.T12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_2"><span id="A4.T12.2.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Vanilla</span></span>
